        "content": [
         {
          "text": "After implementing the fix locally by creating a new ServletContextListener, just discovered that this bug was serendipitously addressed by r8516, with the addition of org.fcrepo.server.utilities.LogSetupContextListener which now houses the code in ServletController that was responsible for setting servlet.fedora.home.",
